<gretldata version="1.3" name="ozconfn" frequency="4" startobs="1975:1" endobs="2010:4" type="time-series">
<description>ozconfn.def

	cons  cpi  inc

	Obs: 144 quarterly observations on Australian macro variables from 1975Q1 2010Q4

	cons	real consumption expenditure, $billions
	cpi	consumer price index
	inc	real net national disposable income, $billions

Source: Australian Bureau of Statistics
	inc is the series A2302465W divided by 1000 to convert from $millions to $billions
	cpi is the series A2325846C
	cons was obtained by multiplying A2302254W by (100/cpi) to convert it to real terms and then dividing by 1000 to convert from $millions to $billions.



